{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve huge logic-based puzzles to unlock 125 real-world paranormal files, whilst building a case to help FBI Special Agents Cullen and Brady investigate a bizarre murder. Discover a fascinating range of Cryptids, Alien Encounters, Unsolved Murders, Conspiracies, Psychic Phenomena, Hauntings, Possessions and much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.poster.avif?t=1761149639\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.webm?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.mp4?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Mosaic of the Strange combines story-driven point &amp; click elements with addictive mosaic logic puzzles! Progress through enormous interlocking minesweeper-like puzzles while you attempt to solve a grisly supernatural murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Every completed region reveals case file details based on real-world paranormal events, strange creatures, unsolved murders, and mysterious deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Mosaic of the Strange takes storytelling much further than previous games in the series, as engaging characters and dialogue draw you further into a compelling murder mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 If you know how to play Minesweeper, you already know how to play a Mosaic game! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Featuring an original soundtrack inspired by classic 90s crime thrillers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Lose yourself in hours of bewitching puzzle-solving as you explore the world of the paranormal._</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.poster.avif?t=1761149639\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.webm?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.mp4?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3444650?t=1761149639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3444650?t=1761149639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/0f335751ec4b4d225d5fa6de25d4d00523e24c9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761149639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/0f335751ec4b4d225d5fa6de25d4d00523e24c9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761149639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features a series of text \"case files\" that are based on real-world events, including:\r\n- Unsolved murders and unusual deaths\r\n- Alien abductions\r\n- Hauntings\r\n- Possessions\r\n- Conspiracy theories"},"demos":[{"appid":4057820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve huge logic-based puzzles to unlock 125 real-world paranormal files, whilst building a case to help FBI Special Agents Cullen and Brady investigate a bizarre murder. Discover a fascinating range of Cryptids, Alien Encounters, Unsolved Murders, Conspiracies, Psychic Phenomena, Hauntings, Possessions and much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.poster.avif?t=1761149639\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.webm?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/bb8e27c3a992109df85197ecfeebf5fb.mp4?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Mosaic of the Strange combines story-driven point &amp; click elements with addictive mosaic logic puzzles! Progress through enormous interlocking minesweeper-like puzzles while you attempt to solve a grisly supernatural murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Every completed region reveals case file details based on real-world paranormal events, strange creatures, unsolved murders, and mysterious deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Mosaic of the Strange takes storytelling much further than previous games in the series, as engaging characters and dialogue draw you further into a compelling murder mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 If you know how to play Minesweeper, you already know how to play a Mosaic game! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Featuring an original soundtrack inspired by classic 90s crime thrillers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Lose yourself in hours of bewitching puzzle-solving as you explore the world of the paranormal._</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.poster.avif?t=1761149639\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.webm?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/extras/a278d23c9af3e591a95c1fc2601dd60e.mp4?t=1761149639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Mark Ffrench"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444650/d46fa726adb4b7429f07c88f5b35b728a21c4f76/header.jpg?t=1761149639","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum: